# The Differents — the song book. One song per line, hand-maintained.
#
# Add a song:     append a line anywhere, then run  python3 tools/build_songs.py
# Drop a song:    set "status": "retired"  (keeps the chart; hides it from the site)
# Delete a line   only if the band never played it at all.
#
# status   rotation = in the working set   bullpen = learned, not set-listed yet
#          retired  = pulled from the show, kept for the record
# sets     "Electric" and/or "Acoustic"; [] if it hasn't been assigned a set
# chords / duration  come off the band's own charts; null just means not written down
#
# The build sorts this file and rewrites it in place, so append wherever you like.
